  "summary": {
    "en": {
      "caveats": null,
      "what": "A systematic literature review analyzed 177 selected papers out of 2,496 retrieved from Web of Science following PRISMA guidelines to chart the evolution of 3D urban modeling from 2015 to 2025. The synthesis details how AI techniques and modern data infrastructure expanded applications across sustainability, transport, resilience, and historical preservation.",
      "why": "It organizes a decade of rapidly accelerating research into a coherent framework, mapping the trajectory of 3D modeling from geometric visualization to multi-scale simulation and identifying critical bottlenecks in social equity, computational overhead, and standardization."
